{"channelId":"UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q","row":["GDCM",14,"Hello, my name is Nicole. I’m a certified canine remedial massage therapist.\n\nWe want to support dogs through mobility changes, recovery, and ageing with tailored bodywork support so families can enjoy more good days together.\n\nThis channel is a inclusive space dedicated to helping dogs feel safe, soft, and supported through bodywork. I share practical tips on canine health, mobility, acupressure points, and gentle massage techniques to help you better understand your dog’s body and comfort, especially as they age, recover, or deal with anxiety.\n\nFind us on instagram and TikTok!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:41.885Z","channelId":"UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f9279ee05d2906875f04528e9054015de52c394fdbb86d6fa061650884b496fc","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c2d8219bd3e13c1a91743e5756a8c1f527011d44320ad5c0d2c4c40d950f3346"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":14,"raw":"14 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:41.885Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"practitioner_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCe6cBCN-Z27F06DgeiSoa2Q"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["massage therapist"],"role":"practitioner_self_report","excerpt":"Hello, my name is